botopink-snap 1
test: create: help ---- the flag table from the one defaults record
subject: help

usage: onze create <name> [options]

  --port <n>              3000     written into onze.json
  --src-dir               on       app/, components/ and lib/ under src/ (the only layout today)
  --import-alias <prefix> @/       the alias prefix written into botopink.json
  --emilia / --no-emilia  on       emilia tokens in the layout, or none
  --example <name>        (none)   copy examples/<name> instead of the scaffold
  --lang <tag>            en       the lang attribute the layout writes
  --libs <dir>            (none)   depend on a local checkout (repository/ layout) by path
  --yes                   off      take every default and skip the prompts
